00:55:15.155 --> 00:55:16.355
for the Commission?

00:55:20.675 --> 00:55:22.595
Okay, seeing none,

00:55:23.635 --> 00:55:28.835
our next regular meeting will be on Monday, April 3, same time, same

00:55:29.330 --> 00:55:30.850
place virtually.

00:55:31.890 --> 00:55:36.210
And with that, I can ask for a motion to adjourn.

00:55:39.650 --> 00:55:41.330
I'll make a motion to adjourn.

00:55:42.565 --> 00:55:43.365
Second.

00:55:43.365 --> 00:55:47.525
>> And I will second it. Okay, that's a nondebatable motion.

00:55:47.605 --> 00:55:48.245
So,

00:55:51.525 --> 00:55:53.365
signify by saying aye.

00:55:56.410 --> 00:55:57.850
Motion is unanimous,

00:55:58.330 --> 00:56:00.890
and we can now stand adjourned.

00:56:00.890 --> 00:56:02.970
I thank you all for participating.

00:56:03.850 --> 00:56:06.330
I'm glad this was a nice short meeting, and

00:56:08.055 --> 00:56:16.215
hopefully, though, the Commission will have some work to do in subsequent months, maybe when construction activities start picking up.

00:56:17.255 --> 00:56:18.375
So, I will

00:56:18.695 --> 00:56:20.695
look forward to seeing you in April,

00:56:20.935 --> 00:56:23.095
and until then, keep well.

00:56:24.842 --> 00:56:27.882
>> You too, everyone. Bye, everybody. Have a good night. Bye all.
